<title>PORTUGAL: Banco Totta sees profit of 15 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Banco Totta sees profit of 15 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese bank Banco Totta &amp; Acores said it expected to have made a consolidated net profit of 15 billion escudos in 1996.</p>
<p>If confirmed, the bank said that the profit would allow the board to propose a dividend of 135 escudos per share.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
